==Battleground==
*6 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Unlike the last two, this stage features an [[Aku Doge]], which can be troubling if you don't break its shield. The shield only has 4,500 hp, so you can whittle it down using your cats or you can use a unit like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] to nuke the shield in one hit. Other than that, this stage is a cakewalk after the Aku Doge.

